Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:28.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那段发言太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was quite a speech you gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,危难关头 群众正需要听到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what these people needed to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那监狱那边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们不进攻 就相安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as they leave us alone, we have no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会报复吧 - 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So no retaliation? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,报复又有何用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would that get us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本希望能改变这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this place could be something else, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,使它变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不够格 全搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't up to the challenge and I screwed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了很多错事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done some terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是当领导的料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not fit to lead these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,群众不该活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need to be terrorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其不该惧怕自己的领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly not by their own leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要让位吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're abdicating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要保女儿一条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I kept her alive long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿就会找到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton would find a…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要点时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need time…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来重整旗鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get myself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想让我暂时代替你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want me to fill in for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你还有谁 米尔顿 马丁内斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else can? Milton? Martinez?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要选择站在监狱那边 我可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you choose your friends in the prison, I'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但镇民需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these people need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这鬼地方除了蚊子和蚂蚁就没别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothing out here but mosquitoes and ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,会逮着松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}a squirrel is bound to scurry across your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,耗不起啊 食物不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so, that ain't much food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.21,0:07:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比没有好\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如去岔道边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have better luck going through one of them houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几个屋子找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}we passed back on the turnoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的新朋友教你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what your new friends taught you? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何掠夺\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to loot for booty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这耗了好几个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been at it for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如找条小溪逮几条鱼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we find a stream, try to look for some fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你是想把我带回路上去 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're just trying to lead me back to the road, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带我去监狱 - 那有住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me over to that prison. - They got shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吃的 还有尿壶可以用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food. A pot to piss in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不是个坏主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might not be a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 也许是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 可不是什么好去处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't gonna be no damn party for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相处需要过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone will get used to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那也没什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.55,0:08:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在总督没准正开乔迁派对呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right about now he's probably hosting a housewarming party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你那伙人的尸体已被他埋在脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}where's he gonna bury what's left of your pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去钓点鱼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hook some fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你是在这里发现泰尔西他们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you said you found Tyreese's group here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 我们加固过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - We secured this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他们是从这里进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought he came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:08:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说还有其他缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means there's another breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱整个正面都不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole front of the prison is unsecure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果行尸进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If walkers just strolled in,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就成了那群全副武装的人的盘中餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it's gonna be cake for a group of armed men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能肯定他一定会来攻击我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we even so sure he's going to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你把他吓跑了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you scared him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一面墙的鱼缸 装满了脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had fish tanks full of heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有行尸的也有人的 当做自己的战利品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers and humans. Trophies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们应该现在就去杀他 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should hit him now. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会预料到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be expecting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偷偷溜回去 给他来一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll sneak back in and put a bullet in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.39,0:09:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他公寓的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where his apartment is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩今晚就能了结此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I could end this tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次他没有防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know you were coming last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were almost killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔被抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl was captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和玛姬差点被处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and Maggie were almost executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克绝对不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick would never allow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他有权对我说三道四吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think he's in any position to make that choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好想想 T仔在这没了命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think this through clearly. T-Dog lost his life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉也是 还有原来监狱那帮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, too. The men that were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该再有更多杀戮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't worth any more killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在等什么 如果他真的要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for? If he's really on his way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就应该离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should be out of here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后去哪 - 我们整个冬天都住在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And go where? - We lived on the road all winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那时候你双腿健全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when you had two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有婴儿哭喊吸引行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we didn't have a baby crying for walkers every four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We'll stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要坚守这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna defend this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 我们去趟坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, you and I will go down to the tombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到缺口在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to figure out where the breach is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it. - You'll need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你留在这里 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, in case anything happens, I need you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人在放哨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's on watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.96,0:11:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着进入冥想状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to induce a meditative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近心神不宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been having trouble…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电池 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}your battery, it's over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 撑住 中头彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're holding. Look at this jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的贡献一直很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been invaluable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想留下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you intend to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我压根没想过离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving's never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就指望着你了 不仅仅为了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I count on you. And not just for your…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的专业知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}your expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把你当朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I consider you a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也当朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾指望过莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I counted on Merle as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁内斯 他是一名优秀的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez, he's a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我需要 他会帮我挡枪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd take a bullet if I needed him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她到底忠于哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure where her loyalties lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解 以她和莫尔的渊源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see how her previous affiliation with Merle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们关系如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how contentious it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会令人产生怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}could cause doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我密切关注她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep tabs on her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁内斯在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Martinez?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他离开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see him leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟谁在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was he with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 没关系的 你可以告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, it's okay. You can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.91,0:13:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他貌似出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out on a run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是肯定句还是疑问句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an answer or a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太确定他身在何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure… where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在和你模棱两可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not whether it was a question or an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然是肯定句 - 他出去干什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was an answer. - A run meaning what specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能是去搜集补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supplies would be a safe bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们库存不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿 我的问题很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton, I want you to give me a specic answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也请你回答得清楚些\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a specific question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他很快会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I bet he'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你担心他的话 他没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he's okay, if that's what you're worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,锅炉房外的墓地又被行尸占领了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tombs outside the boiler room are overrun again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经清理过那里了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole section had been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有行尸源源不断的涌入\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a steady stream of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督应该已经出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor is supposedly on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们还在对付行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're stuck in here with walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,进退维谷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:15:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后说一次 我们不能逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last time, running is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 如果墓地满是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, if the tombs have filled up again,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们迟早会涌进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it may just be a matter of time before they push in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,围栏支撑不住它们也会进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or until some fence gives way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一有尸群路过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if one of them herds is passing through?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者干脆住下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or settled?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭我们几个可对付不了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't handle that with just the few of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we need…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去看看监狱的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just need to scout the far side of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查明情况 - 你要去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find out what's going on. - You're going out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开车 快去快回 - 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take a car and make it quick. - I'll drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你留下来 帮忙设防\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you stay here. Help with the fortifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带玛姬去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定她愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure she's up to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得查明行尸是怎么进入墓地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find out how the walkers are getting into the tombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈那件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 你需要解开心结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, you need to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗 是你需要吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do? Or you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 你想让我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我说 他扒光了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to say he made me get naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让我站在他面前吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stand in front of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走到我背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came up behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体贴着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pushed himself against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸遍了我全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put his hands all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他按下我的头 把我推到桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slammed my head down and bent me over a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,强奸我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rape me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉好点儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是在… - 我有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not trying to… - I had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么我脱掉衣服 要么他把你手剁掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either I take off my shirt or he would take off your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听着莫尔在隔壁房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just listened to Merle beating the shit out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你打得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用院子里的铁板加固栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll reinforce this with some metal from the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就躲在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll just duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望一切平安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope nothing happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕死枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns scare the bejesus out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当年是用玩具枪抢劫的加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I robbed a gas station with a toy gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至没从兜里拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never even took it out of my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说奥斯卡才是小偷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Oscar was the thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进监狱是因为药物问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were in here for pharmaceuticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你们觉得我是个暴徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't want y'all to think I was a violent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那照你所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进监狱是因为一把玩具枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in here for a toy gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天警察在我兄弟家里找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day the cops found me at my brother's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兜里还揣着那把水枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still had the water pistol in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他们发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore up and down that…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说那是我拥有的唯一武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was the only weapon I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不相信有蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they said they didn't believe anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,用水枪抢加油站还成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be so stupid and get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们翻遍了我哥哥家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they turned my brother's house upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终找到了他的点38手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and found his.38.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「符合描述」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said it "Matched the description."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪名成立 「武装抢劫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Armed robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我都不知道这玩意儿怎么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you the truth, I don't even know how to use this damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在说的都是实话了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all about the truth now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹已经上满膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fully loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿能不要开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope it stays that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好心的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quite a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这里像是萨沃齐湾（美国佐治亚州西南方）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smells to me like the Sawhatchee Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没有那么靠西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't go west enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有条河 一定是黄衫河（位于美国佐治亚州西部的拉格兰奇）\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a river down there, it's got to be the Yellow Jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你中风了说胡话吗 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a stroke, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没接近过黄衫河\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't never even come close to Yellow Jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们没往西走 只是有点靠南\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't go west. Just a little bit south. That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然失去了一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have lost my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你失去了方向感\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you lost your sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:19:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想赌什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不想赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to bet nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一条河而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a body of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要把一切都当做比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's everything got to be a competition with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想找点乐子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to have a little fun here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要小题大做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to get your panties all in a bundle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 野生动物发疯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, wild animals getting wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.37,0:20:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 是个婴儿 - 少胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's a baby. - Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不如在我耳朵里撒泡尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just piss in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后告诉我下雨了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me it's raining, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一对浣熊在缠绵的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there's the sound of a couple of coons making love, sweet love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂我意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.91,0:20:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我才不会为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, I ain't wasting my bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个素不相识的陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a couple of strangers that ain't never cooked me a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.29,0:20:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}or felicitated my piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放聪明点 学学我 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be wise to adopt it, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我是在帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. I'm trying to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl! I got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 西语佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, beaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是表达谢意的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't no way to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们至少也得给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The least they can do is give us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉米卷饼什么的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}an enchilada or something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.83,0:23:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy does it, senorita.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.08,0:23:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,从车里滚出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.43,0:23:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是在对我说话吧 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not talking to me, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.61,0:23:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 赶紧离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in your car and get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.94,0:23:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get in your car!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:39.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黄衫河）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.78,0:24:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干嘛 用那玩意指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shit you doing, pointing that thing at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.99,0:24:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were scared, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.51,0:24:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮人太不懂礼数\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were rude is what they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.23,0:24:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道该进贡点东西表示感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rude and they owed us a token of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.60,0:24:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不欠我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't owe us nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当自己是活菩萨拯救苍生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You helping people out of the goodness of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.43,0:24:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会白白送命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you might die doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.10,0:24:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一套也是瑞克警长教你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that something your sheriff Rick taught you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.29,0:24:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.23,0:25:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你就会不管他们死活了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, otherwise you would have just left them to the biters, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.59,0:25:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去救你了 可你不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I went back for you. You weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,锯掉你手的也不是我 而是你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't cut off your hand, neither. You did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你拷在屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way before they locked you up on that roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.47,0:25:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你之前自作自受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.49,0:25:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你知道哪点可笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… you know what's funny to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.82,0:25:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟瑞克警长现在倒是亲如一家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Sheriff Rick are like this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.55,0:25:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you a penny and a fiddle of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.56,0:25:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定没告诉过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you never told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们原本计划要趁天黑抢劫他们营地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we were planning on robbing that camp blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.79,0:25:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为没有我在你身边照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it didn't 'cause I wasn't there to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.46,0:25:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小时候一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like when we were kids, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那时谁抛下了谁 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who left who then? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.17,0:25:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才失去了一只手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Is that why I lost my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.27,0:25:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你是个头脑简单的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost your hand 'cause you're a simple minded piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? You don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.82,0:25:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他也虐待了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I didn't know he was…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.30,0:25:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他虐待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.78,0:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像对你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才会先离开家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you left first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.29,0:26:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须走 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.37,0:26:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会忍不住杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have killed him otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.46,0:26:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.14,0:26:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,回我现在的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.84,0:26:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能跟你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前试图杀死那黑妞的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to kill that black bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.76,0:26:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点杀死那中国男孩的也是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn near killed the Chinese kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是韩国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Korean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.06,0:26:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.93,0:26:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我没法和你一起回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter, man. I just can't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 走开的人也许是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I may be the one walking away…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真正离开的人是你 又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're the one that's leaving… again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.82,0:26:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.68,0:27:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.65,0:27:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.56,0:27:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会去伍德伯里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going back to Woodbury, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.73,0:27:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.03,0:27:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起 - 我去就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go with you. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这是个好主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you possibly think that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.69,0:27:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just sit on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.28,0:27:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你就去找个奶粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went on a simple formula run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.49,0:27:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果却被打得鼻青脸肿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got the crap beat out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.01,0:27:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬也被袭击 - 你是说这是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie was attacked. - Are you saying this is my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.37,0:27:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - I did what I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.96,0:27:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.89,0:27:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.89,0:27:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是这个世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's one of the two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.24,0:27:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最珍爱的两个人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}most precious to me in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.90,0:27:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任你才把她托付给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you with her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.69,0:28:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依然信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.22,0:28:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这怒气会让你送命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This rage is going to get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.80,0:28:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔走了 瑞克也崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Daryl gone and Rick wandering Crazytown,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.69,0:28:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我说的算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the next in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.84,0:28:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要证明什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you proving?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.42,0:29:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.10,0:29:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能替我喂喂她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you help me feed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.06,0:29:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去给爸爸弄点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make daddy something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.12,0:29:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.65,0:29:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样拿着奶瓶就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep the bottle like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.90,0:29:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然她会胀气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise she gets gassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.47,0:29:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.57,0:30:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.28,0:30:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.36,0:31:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一瘸一拐地走这么大老远过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I wouldn't have hobbled all the way down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.48,0:31:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有要紧的事跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.78,0:31:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近能回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming back soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.14,0:31:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦满腔怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn's on the warpath.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.66,0:31:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很精明 但他难胜任领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart as he is, he can't fill your boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心他会鲁莽行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid he's reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正是需要你时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.08,0:31:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然你那么担心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're so worried about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.20,0:31:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来领导吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.17,0:31:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.28,0:31:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.69,0:31:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.94,0:31:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.59,0:31:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还需要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.69,0:32:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮到你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.09,0:32:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.53,0:32:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Lor…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.03,0:32:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,满眼都是洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.25,0:32:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道那不是真的她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it's not really her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她出现一定有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's got to be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.50,0:32:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有所深意 你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to mean something, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.73,0:33:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话那头的也是她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it her on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.89,0:33:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.51,0:33:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.05,0:33:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.49,0:33:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还会看见他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.10,0:33:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在寻找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.99,0:33:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不清楚 某事某物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.85,0:33:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切必有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.19,0:33:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 一切可能说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.52,0:33:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切总归会有意义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it does. It can make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.22,0:33:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来 一切都会说得通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I think in time it will make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.74,0:33:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick…?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.43,0:33:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.63,0:33:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.48,0:34:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克被压垮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stress getting to your man Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能怪他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you blame him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.29,0:34:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.82,0:34:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱里我可见过不少崩溃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here I've seen plenty of dudes crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.06,0:34:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.43,0:34:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面更适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got on better on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.22,0:34:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切更有意义 你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things made more sense, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.00,0:34:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱里有规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.75,0:34:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活更简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life was more simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.19,0:34:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想念你兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you miss your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.55,0:34:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.47,0:34:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.92,0:34:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有经济问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a real money problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎讲 - 不借给哥钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of problem? - He didn't lend me any.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.39,0:35:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}One time that son of a bitch…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.44,0:36:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.87,0:36:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.65,0:36:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.96,0:38:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔 快离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Hershel. Get the hell out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yes. Baby.
